  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\n**Logic: (First term **× **2) + Second term = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern in the given sets:\n\n(17, 24, 58)\n\n__**17 × 2**__ + 24 = 58\n\n__**34 + 24**__ = 58\n\n58 = 58\n\n(26, 37, 89)\n\n__**26 × 2**__ + 37 = 89 \n\n__**52 + 37**__ = 89\n\n89 = 89\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\n**Option 1) (15, 17, 47)**\n\n__**15 **× 2__ + 17 = 47\n\n__**30 + 17**__ = 47\n\n**47 = 47**\n\nOption 2) (41, 39, 125)\n\n**41 **__× 2__ + 39 = 125 \n\n__**82 + 39**__ = 125\n\n121 ≠ 125\n\nOption 3) (10, 20, 44)\n\n__**10 **× 2__ + 20 = 44\n\n__**20 + 20**__ = 44\n\n40 ≠ 44\n\nOption 4) (21, 38, 96)\n\n__**21 **× 2__ + 38 = 96 \n\n__**42 + 38**__ = 96\n\n80 ≠ 96\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
